{"lang":"ml","lot":2,"out":[{"pack":"humor","key":"break_ice","register":"neutral","fr":"Pour briser la glace, je vous offre un café ?","text":"സംസാരം തുടങ്ങാൻ, ഞാൻ നിങ്ങൾക്ക് ഒരു കാപ്പി വാങ്ങിത്തരട്ടെ?","back":"Pour commencer la conversation, puis-je vous offrir un café ?","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"just_kidding","register":"informal","fr":"Je plaisante, bien sûr !","text":"തീർച്ചയായും, ഞാൻ തമാശ പറഞ്ഞതാണ്!","back":"Bien sûr, je plaisantais !","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"monday_irony","register":"ironic","fr":"Génial, on est lundi…","text":"കൊള്ളാം, ഇന്ന് തിങ്കളാഴ്ച…","back":"Bien, aujourd'hui c'est lundi…","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"monday_irony","register":"neutral_meaning","fr":"Je n'aime pas les lundis.","text":"എനിക്ക് തിങ്കളാഴ്ച ഇഷ്ടമല്ല.","back":"Je n'aime pas le lundi.","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"}]}